# settings-close: the ways the panel closes (D2, SM · States › Keyboard). Enter in the panel closes
# it, the pick before it kept and the gear's ring showing; the gear clicked again closes it, the
# focus on the gear without its ring; a press inside it (the help line) closes nothing, a press
# outside (the plane's empty part) does and goes on to the plane; Tab past the list moves the focus
# on to the picker and closes it; Shift+Tab from the toggle reaches the gear and the panel stays,
# Esc there closes it (before the view's own Esc); Shift+Tab past the gear closes it too. Judge the
# keyboard's parts against Chromium's shots (plan call 3 f).
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
click 1383 48
wait 700
key ArrowDown
key Enter
wait 300
shot enter
click 1383 48
wait 700
click 1383 48
wait 300
shot gear-again
click 1383 48
wait 700
click 1200 164
wait 16
shot press-inside
click 700 700
wait 300
shot press-outside
move 760 48
click 1383 48
wait 700
tab
wait 300
shot tab-out
click 1383 48
wait 700
tab shift
tab shift
wait 16
shot shift-tab-gear
key Escape
wait 300
shot escape-on-gear
key Enter
wait 700
tab shift
tab shift
tab shift
wait 300
shot shift-tab-out
